      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extract user data').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "=**Frequently Asked Questions**\n\n**1. How can I track my order?**\nYou can track your order using your Order ID. Please provide your Order ID, and we’ll check the latest status for you.\n\n**2. How long does delivery take?**\nStandard delivery usually takes 3–5 business days.\n\n**3. Can I cancel my order?**\nYes, you can cancel your order if it has not been shipped yet. Please provide your Order ID for assistance.\n\n**4. Can I return a product?**\nYes, products can be returned within 7 days of delivery, subject to our return policy.\n\n**5. What if I received a damaged or wrong product?**\nPlease contact our support team with your Order ID, and we’ll assist you with the replacement or return.\n\n**6. How can I contact customer support?**\nYou can contact our support team by providing your Order ID and describing your issue. We’ll guide you through the next steps.\n\n",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
